WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.587 --> 00:00:13.407
I brought something for you, Danny.

2
00:00:14.287 --> 00:00:15.688
It came from my world.

3
00:00:15.708 --> 00:00:20.129
Danny: That’s so cool!

4
00:00:20.149 --> 00:00:22.770
Hopian: It’s beautiful, isn’t it?

5
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.671
Danny: But I thought all the color was gone from your world!

6
00:00:26.691 --> 00:00:28.911
Hopian: So did I.

7
00:00:29.491 --> 00:00:31.552
But I found something the other day.

8
00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:34.893
Hopian: I have a young son named Bello.

9
00:00:35.753 --> 00:00:37.233
He is two years old.

10
00:00:37.253 --> 00:00:42.835
Hopian: When I came home the other day, he looked happy.

11
00:00:42.855 --> 00:00:46.716
Hopian: He was running around with a big smile.

12
00:00:46.736 --> 00:00:49.657
Hopian: I guessed something was going on.

13
00:00:51.738 --> 00:00:53.258
He led me into his room.

14
00:00:53.298 --> 00:00:56.419
Hopian: He took some clay from under his bed.

15
00:00:56.439 --> 00:00:59.920
Hopian: He started making a circus with it.

16
00:01:00.556 --> 00:01:06.961
Hopian: There were big blue horses, a large red tent, [n3@and a funny yellow clown.

17
00:01:06.981 --> 00:01:09.103
Hopian: Bello laughed.

18
00:01:09.643 --> 00:01:11.004
His eyes were shining.

19
00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:14.107
Then I noticed something.

20
00:01:14.127 --> 00:01:17.970
Hopian: His beautiful fur was shining with color!

21
00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:23.094
Hopian: I realized that Bello’s imagination was giving him color.

22
00:01:23.114 --> 00:01:26.837
Hopian: I was so happy that I cried.

23
00:01:26.857 --> 00:01:32.065
Hopian: I took his clay into my hands and closed my eyes.

24
00:01:32.085 --> 00:01:36.369
Hopian: I wondered how this little bit of clay could help.

25
00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:42.974
Hopian: When I opened my eyes, I was outside your classroom.

26
00:01:42.994 --> 00:01:45.677
Danny: The clay led you to me?

27
00:01:45.697 --> 00:01:48.679
Hopian: My imagination led me to you.

28
00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:52.702
Your ability with clay will heal our world.

29
00:01:52.722 --> 00:01:56.486
Hopian: It will be a colorful, happy place again.

30
00:01:56.506 --> 00:01:59.128
Danny: I don’t know how to do that!

31
00:02:00.372 --> 00:02:02.073
Hopian: I know you can do it, Danny.

32
00:02:02.093 --> 00:02:04.855
Danny: But you haven’t told me how!

33
00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:08.778
Hopian: Danny, I can’t stay here any longer.

34
00:02:09.579 --> 00:02:10.399
I have to go now.

35
00:02:10.459 --> 00:02:13.601
Hopian: But I’m going to leave this clay with you.

36
00:02:14.382 --> 00:02:15.823
Look for it in your desk.

37
00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:20.386
Danny: Hopian, don’t go!

38
00:02:20.446 --> 00:02:24.289
Hopian: Danny, use your imagination.

39
00:02:25.169 --> 00:02:26.831
Find your way to Ginormous.

40
00:02:26.851 --> 00:02:30.577
Hopian: Once you’re there, I’ll help you any way I can.

41
00:02:30.658 --> 00:02:34.741
Danny: But I have no idea where Ginormous is!

42
00:02:35.361 --> 00:02:36.522
How can I get there?

43
00:02:36.542 --> 00:02:41.066
Hopian: Remember, your imagination can unlock any door.

44
00:02:41.086 --> 00:02:43.468
Hopian: Good-bye, Danny.

45
00:02:44.408 --> 00:02:46.070
I know I’ll see you soon.

46
00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:49.392
Danny: Hopian!

47
00:02:49.432 --> 00:02:52.975
Hopian: Your imagination can unlock any
